{"postId":"6b077c64c5a003caa3d25413","status":"published","content":"One up at HT: 30 unbeaten. Until Lille. Pavlović or the second half? 🦍\n\nLille 2-1 Bayern: Bayern had been unbeaten in 30 Champions League games when leading by one goal at the break (FC Bayern). Not anymore.\nThe reason: open-play xG Bayern 0.25, Lille 2.06. 0.93 of Bayern's 1.18 xG came from set pieces (BBC Sport/Opta).\nBayern's xG: 1.00 in the first half, 0.20 in the second, while Lille's rose from 0.57 to 1.55 (ESPN shot map). Pavlović's own goal at 65' decided it.\n\nPavlović, or the second half: who lost this one? 👇\n\n#FCBayern #Bayern #LOSC #Lille #ChampionsLeague #UCL #Kompany #footballanalysis #tactics #scoutbrief","scheduledFor":"2026-11-26T01:25:08.943Z","publishedAt":"2026-11-26T01:26:22.811Z","analytics":{"impressions":139,"reach":121,"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"saves":0,"clicks":0,"views":139,"reposts":0,"igReelsVideoViewTotalTime":1055692,"igReelsAvgWatchTime":8513,"reelsSkipRate":51.6,"completionRate":0,"profileViews":0,"websiteClicks":0,"impressionSources":{},"audienceTypes":{},"audienceCountries":{},"retentionCurve":{},"replays":0,"videoDurationSeconds":37,"lastUpdated":"2026-11-27T16:14:44Z","platformPostUrl":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DgL66hDBh-e/","engagementRate":0},"platformAnalytics":[{"platform":"instagram","status":"published","platformPostId":"17913448293569185","accountId":"6ad5bc58ea5889c95a4c443b","accountUsername":"thescoutbrief","analytics":{"impressions":139,"reach":121,"likes":0,"comments":0,"shares":0,"saves":0,"clicks":0,"views":139,"igReelsAvgWatchTime":8513,"igReelsVideoViewTotalTime":1055692,"reelsSkipRate":51.6,"completionRate":0,"profileViews":0,"websiteClicks":0,"impressionSources":{},"audienceTypes":{},"audienceCountries":{},"retentionCurve":{},"replays":0,"reposts":0,"videoDurationSeconds":37,"engagementRate":0,"lastUpdated":"2026-11-27T16:14:44Z"},"syncStatus":"synced","platformPostUrl":"https://www.instagram.com/reel/DgL66hDBh-e/"}],"plat